      <title>Hughes’ OT goal for Team USA vs Canada in Olympic final averages 26M live viewers on NBC, Peacock</title>
      <link>https://www.macombdaily.com/2026/02/24/hughes-ot-goal-for-team-usa-vs-canada-in-olympic-final-averages-26m-live-viewers-on-nbc-peacock/</link>
      <description>Jack Hughes’ overtime goal, which gave the United States its first Olympic gold medal in men’s hockey since 1980, drew an average audience of 26 million viewers on NBC and Peacock in the U.S., according to Nielsen’s Big Data + Panel ratings and Adobe Analytics digital data.</description>
